&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a supply chain or manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a receiving role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people management skills and technical understanding to provide hands-on leadership&lt;/li&gt;
