&lt;li&gt;Monday - Friday 11:30am to 10:00pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friday - Monday 3:30pm to 3:30am&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friday - Monday 4:30am to 4:30pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
