&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GLOBAL LOGISTICS LEAD (STARLINK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As the Global Logistics Lead, you will own end-to-end logistics operations, including fulfillment, distribution networks, and capital expenditure (CAPEX) infrastructure projects. This role oversees first-mile transportation, middle-mile logistics, and last-mile delivery across global markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;You will design and implement optimal freight routing solutions while building strategic internal and external partnerships, processes, and tools to support production, engineering, finance, and supply chain objectives. With full accountability and oversight&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;all logistics movements related to the program, you will identify and leverage partnerships and synergies to deliver timely, cost-efficient solutions to internal and external customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;STRATEGIC OPERATIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Design and execute the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;regional or country specific&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;fulfillment and distribution network strategy, including first mile, fulfillment operations, and last mile, in alignment with business growth objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Develop and implement logistics network buildout strategies in direct support of CAPEX infrastructure projects, ensuring full alignment with overall business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Factory Operations, Supplier, Supply Chain, Production, and Customer Support teams to integrate logistics planning with overall operational and commercial goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Analyze network data, performance metrics, and operational analytics to identify opportunities for cost reduction, efficiency gains, and service level improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Develop innovative logistics solutions and strategic partnerships to strengthen the end-to-end network.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of operational excellence, accountability, and continuous improvement across internal teams and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;STAKEHOLDER &amp;amp; NETWORK MANAGEMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s7&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Lead logistics project planning activities for capital infrastructure initiatives, including scope definition, objectives, deliverables, timelines, and risk management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s7&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Provide clear and timely updates to internal and external stakeholders on program progress, milestones, network development, and sourcing strategy effectiveness using both quantitative and qualitative reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s7&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Conduct program reviews, performance evaluations, and stakeholder alignment sessions to drive continuous improvement and secure buy-in for changes in logistics networks and partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;TACTICAL OPERATIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s7&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end logistics flow&amp;nbsp;from factory and supplier origins (first mile) through fulfillment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and or cross dock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;operations all the way to final customer delivery (last mile).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Lead full-scope logistics operations for large-scale infrastructure and CAPEX initiatives, optimizing complex global transportation networks, ensuring compliance with customs and international trade regulations, and delivering critical materials, equipment, and oversized cargo on time to enable program success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact and strategic relationship owner for logistics partners, 3PLs, carriers, and fulfillment providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Negotiate high-impact partnerships, lead sourcing and performance management of logistics providers, and continuously optimize routing, warehousing, and delivery strategies to improve speed, reliability, and cost efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Drive day-to-day execution while proactively identifying and implementing process improvements that reduce costs and elevate overall network performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s3&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in supply chain, logistics, business, engineering, or a related discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in global or regional logisti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;cs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;or fulfillment teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
