&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of U.S. and international logistics regulations, import/export compliance processes, and regional market dynamics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Proficiency with logistics software, warehouse management systems (WMS), and transportation management systems (TMS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s6&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s8&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical skills with a demonstrated ability to leverage data, KPIs, and metrics to guide network strategy and decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
