&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is currently seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Occupational Therapist, OT,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;full time &lt;/strong&gt;opportunity performing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;home health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;visits for our&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;office&amp;nbsp;located in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Roxboro, North Carolina.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;This office services adult and geriatric patients on a per visit basis. This position is covering clients in their homes throughout&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Franklin, Granville, and Vance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;counties.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;As a home care Occupational Therapist, you will be an integral member of a multi-disciplinary health care team that provides rehabilitative care and skilled nursing to clients, affording them the opportunity to receive the medical care required to remain at home. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Sxdj52KNt5A?t=&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
