&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;• A current nursing license in good standing in New Jersey&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Graduation from an accredited and approved nursing program, as indicated by school transcript or diploma&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA recognizes and rewards our RNs who set and maintain the highest standards of excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
