&lt;p&gt;Here at BAYADA, you have the &lt;strong&gt;flexibility to choose&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;where you want to work, who you want to work with, and the hours you want to work! We currently have openings for HHAs and Nursing Students to work 1 on 1 with our adult clients. Not certified? Ask about our affordable&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;certification&amp;nbsp;training program&lt;/strong&gt;! BAYADA Home Health Care has an immediate need for caregivers in all of Burlington County, NJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Rate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private in-home clients - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$18/hr - $20/hr&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private facility clients - $18/hr - $20/hr&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling - full-time, part-time, daytime, evening, and overnight shifts available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short commute times – we try to match you to opportunities near your home&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship programs and certified Dementia Training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick time and paid time off (PTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health benefits available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 on call and clinical nursing support so you always have someone to call if you have questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All protective gear provided - masks, gloves, sanitizer and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All types of clients available - in-home care, hospice, facility assisted living, and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Current Certified Home Health Aide (CHHA) license in good standing with the NJ Board of Nursing. At least (1) year of experience as companion or CHHA. Not certified? BAYADA hosts daytime and evening HHA certification classes, as well as certified nursing assistant (CNA) conversion courses every month! Click our APPLY NOW button and a BAYADA representative will reach out to you about our courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HHA Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal care: bathing, grooming, toileting, feeding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambulation / Transfers / mechanical lift devices / range of motion exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vital sign checks: temperature, pulse, respiration&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home management: laundry, meal preparation, bed making, etc.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medication assistance&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have questions? Click the APPLY NOW button and a BAYADA representative will reach out ASAP to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
