&lt;li data-start=&quot;3033&quot; data-end=&quot;3073&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3035&quot; data-end=&quot;3073&quot;&gt;CEU reimbursement + ongoing training&lt;/p&gt;
