&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; partner with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;ANZ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; sales leaders to create relevant, localized experiences—from insight-driven campaigns to high-touch events—that align with AvePoint’s position as the leading next-gen data security company. Your focus will be on building strong account engagement, accelerating the buyer journey, and fostering customer loyalty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
